   "range": [
    5,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route124_EventScript_151DF8",
   "texts": {
    "Route124_Text_1C0624": "Hey, are you lost at sea?\\pIf you can beat my POKéMON, I can\\nserve as your pilot.$",
    "Route124_Text_1C0675": "I lost my bearings in battle!$",
    "Route124_Text_1C0693": "Many people lose their bearings at sea.\\pIf you're that sort, you should refer\\nto the POKéNAV's MAP.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 2,
   "x": 33,
   "y": 25,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_SWIMMER_M",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_WALK_SEQUENCE_RIGHT_DOWN_LEFT_UP",
   "range": [
    5,
    3
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route124_EventScript_151E0F",
   "texts": {
    "Route124_Text_1C06F7": "Hm! You're riding a POKéMON instead\\nof swimming yourself...\\pI am envious!$",
    "Route124_Text_1C0741": "Oh!\\nI can't...$",
    "Route124_Text_1C0750": "I'm getting chilled...\\nI've been in the water too long...\\pI wish I could ride a POKéMON like you...$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 3,
   "x": 14,
   "y": 27,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_SWIMMER_F",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_ROTATE_CLOCKWISE",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route124_EventScript_151E26",
   "texts": {
    "Route124_Text_1C07B4": "If you just float in the sea like\\nthis, POKéMON come around to play.$",
    "Route124_Text_1C07F9": "Oh...\\nLost at sea...$",
    "Route124_Text_1C080E": "While swimming, I noticed that some\\nPOKéMON attack, and some just watch.\\pI guess POKéMON have personalities\\nof their own.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 4,
   "x": 49,
   "y": 45,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_SWIMMER_F",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_ROTATE_CLOCKWISE",
   "range": [
    6,
    8
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route124_EventScript_151E64",
   "texts": {
    "Route124_Text_1C0936": "I'm growing bored of swimming...\\nHow about a battle?$",
    "Route124_Text_1C096B": "I had no idea that you were\\nthis strong!$",
    "Route124_Text_1C0994": "All the effort you put in must have\\nmade you this strong.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 5,
   "x": 60,
   "y": 74,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_SWIMMER_M",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_WALK_RIGHT_AND_LEFT",
   "range": [
    7,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route124_EventScript_151E7B",
   "texts": {
    "Route124_Text_1C09CE": "Fufufufu... I dive deep underwater\\nto go deep under cover.\\lPlumbing the depths is where I excel!$",
    "Route124_Text_1C0A2F": "Glub, glub, glub...\\nI'm sinking...$",
    "Route124_Text_1C0A52": "I have it on good authority that\\nthere's a DIVE spot around here.\\pIt gives me the urge to go deep\\nagain...$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
